## ObjectType: Financial Instrument

Fictional equity or debt master. An issuer can issue both asset classes; currency, face/share units and quote factor govern valuation.

### Semantic Provenance

| Key | Value |
|---|---|
| source_iri | https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FBC/FinancialInstruments/FinancialInstruments/FinancialInstrument |
| source_label | financial instrument |
| source_definition | written contract that gives rise to both a financial asset of one entity and a financial liability of another entity |
| source_revision | 2d73435a4419b66b7c9f44cb9763e35fe8ac7890 |
| source_license | MIT |
| source_repository | https://github.com/edmcouncil/fibo |

### Data Properties

| Name | Display Name | Type | Description | Mapped Field |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| instrument_id | Instrument Id | string | Stable unique identifier of this business record. | instrument_id |
| name | Name | string | Human-readable fictional business name with equivalent bilingual meaning. | name |
| issuer_id | Issuer Id | string | Foreign key to legal_entities; blank only where contract declares absent/inapplicable evidence. | issuer_id |
| asset_class | Asset Class | string | Named business attribute constrained by model-contract.json types and controlled vocabulary. Allowed values: bond, equity. | asset_class |
| currency | Currency | string | Instrument denomination; must agree across trade, instruction, opening and position. | currency |
| unit | Unit | string | Share count for equity, currency face units for bonds; not bond contract lots. Allowed values: face_unit, share. | unit |
| price_basis | Price Basis | string | Per share for equity, dirty price per 100 face for debt; must agree with asset class and multiplier. Allowed values: dirty_per_100, per_share. | price_basis |
| price_multiplier | Price Multiplier | decimal | 1 for a per-share equity quote; 0.01 for dirty bond price per 100 face units. | price_multiplier |
| maturity_date | Maturity Date | date | Date of this business event under the fictional weekday calendar; distinguish planned and actual. | maturity_date |
| is_synthetic | Is Synthetic | boolean | Named business attribute constrained by model-contract.json types and controlled vocabulary. | is_synthetic |

